004-refused.xtpl:7: a one-line 'if' inside another goes in parentheses: 'if a exec (if b exec x else y), z'.
004-refused.xtpl:8: a one-line 'for' inside another goes in parentheses: 'if a exec (if b exec x else y), z'.
004-refused.xtpl:9: a 'for ... in lines()' on one line is refused: write the block, which closes the file on every way out.
